{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Confluence is a first person 3D platformer game with a focus on completing levels quickly and flawlessly. Each level is built around the core mechanic of swapping between two different worlds, such that the presence or absence of platforms and obstacles will open a path forward. Unlock new abilities as you progress through the game to add even more ways to speed through levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 64 levels to platform your way through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement abilities to experiment with such as the jetpack, wall run, grapple, and phasing through walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically save best times. Replay levels to set new records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 hidden collectables to find throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story behind Project Confluence's  creation as you make your way from level to level.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621620?t=1767129735","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621620?t=1767129735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621620/b84bad5bcbadbb112cec1f33e6d53aff439e7a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767129735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621620/b84bad5bcbadbb112cec1f33e6d53aff439e7a21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767129735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Fami